WEBVTT

00:04:28.442 --> 00:04:31.831
who just happened to be my friends
who had begged to be in my shows,

00:04:31.855 --> 00:04:33.887
were so radical to some people,

00:04:33.911 --> 00:04:36.847
and, unfortunately,
still are different or strange to some,

00:04:36.871 --> 00:04:39.776
that it became a huge part
of what we're known for.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:45.091
However, inclusivity means nothing
if it's only surface level.

00:04:46.473 --> 00:04:47.639
Behind the scenes,

00:04:47.663 --> 00:04:49.901
from the photographer,
to the casting director,

00:04:49.925 --> 00:04:51.082
to the interns,

00:04:51.106 --> 00:04:53.981
who is making the decisions
behind the scenes

00:04:54.005 --> 00:04:55.822
is just as important.

00:04:56.601 --> 00:05:00.344
It's imperative to include
diverse decision-makers in the process,